        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for your morning coffee! <strong>Point &amp; click</strong> your way through a charming hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of weird animated townsfolk and a boppin'<strong> original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to  comedy puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <i><strong>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</strong></i> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of distilled ridiculousness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/aeb5ff288c67047fe93c8a968bb27eda.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=368 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/aeb5ff288c67047fe93c8a968bb27eda.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game respects your time! It takes about  1 hour to complete, your mileage may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/8cfa3201e9fe4e6218e0e62194fb69f2.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/8cfa3201e9fe4e6218e0e62194fb69f2.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your  will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bru</strong> has tighty whitie undies that are not only <i>stylish</i>, but also <i>functional</i>! Store all the items you find in your <strong>PANTSVENTORY™</strong> and use them in bonkers ways to reach your goal of <strong>MILK</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local townsfolk of <strong>KIFFTOWN</strong> are ready and waiting to exchange ridiculous banter with Bru, or give him a restraining order for <i>VERBAL HARASSMENT</i>. Blurt out <strong>non sequiturs</strong> if you're feeling <i>saucy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the hoarder inside us all! <strong>Collect the stickers</strong> littered around the world to unlock a SUPER SECRET SURPRISE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Streamer-Friendly:</strong> The entire original soundtrack is 100% DMCA-safe and Content ID free for videos. Stream and monetize your Let's Plays without worry!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Actual Quotes &amp; Reviews</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you love point-and-click adventures, have a taste for irreverent comedy, or simply want to play something that’ll make you laugh out loud, then don’t miss <i>Bru &amp; Boegie Episode 1 – Get Da MILK!</i>. It’s stupid. It’s clever. It’s brilliant. And if Episode 1 is this good, I can’t wait to see where the boys go when the whole world’s on the line. Episode 2 can’t come soon enough!&quot; - <i>GeekGasm</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; - <i>Krizezivota</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; - <i>dunkkke</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; - <i>latetothegames</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Absolute masterpiece.” - <i>Alene</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I honestly loved every minute of this! So witty and clever, all the little comments about the state of the world as well, just brilliant. Great little character and characters, and the voice acting was on par too! I really hope we get more episodes, like, Get Da Sugaaaa!&quot; - <i>VonWeavey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it” - <i>hyprZona</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I LOVE THIS” - <i>Jaelix</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Full animation, big fan, a lotta lotta money went into this game - incredible. Epic cutscenes, 10/10 voice acting.&quot; - <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That was officially one of the strangest games I think I've ever played in my life.&quot; - also <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for your morning coffee! <strong>Point &amp; click</strong> your way through a charming hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of weird animated townsfolk and a boppin'<strong> original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to  comedy puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <i><strong>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</strong></i> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of distilled ridiculousness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/aeb5ff288c67047fe93c8a968bb27eda.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=368 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/aeb5ff288c67047fe93c8a968bb27eda.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game respects your time! It takes about  1 hour to complete, your mileage may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/8cfa3201e9fe4e6218e0e62194fb69f2.poster.avif?t=1787653951\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/8cfa3201e9fe4e6218e0e62194fb69f2.mp4?t=1787653951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your  will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"